# WalletConnect — 手机浏览器连 MetaMask 必需（免费）
# 1. https://dashboard.reown.com 注册 → Create Project → 复制 Project ID
# 2. Cloudflare → Variables → Production → NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID（Plaintext，需参与 build）
# 3. Retry deployment
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://web3-farm.pages.dev

# Escrow contract on Ethereum mainnet (required for on-chain swap)
# Set in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables (build time)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SWAP_CONTRACT=

# Optional — mainnet RPC for NFT verify + wallet reads (browser CORS-safe)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ETH_RPC_URL=https://ethereum.publicnode.com

# Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables → Production
# Type: Secret（不要勾选 “Expose to build”）
#
# ALCHEMY_API_KEY — NFT 验真 + 图片备用源
# OPENSEA_API_KEY — NFT 图片主源（Nobody 等 IPFS 图在公网常 504，OpenSea CDN 更稳）
#
# OpenSea 正式 Key（推荐）:
# 1. https://docs.opensea.io/reference/api-keys 申请 Developer API Key
# 2. Cloudflare → web3-farm 项目 → Settings → Variables and secrets → Add → OPENSEA_API_KEY
# 3. Deployments → 最新部署 → Retry deployment（或 push main 触发新部署）
# 4. 验证: /api/nft/image?contract=0xa28d6a8eb65a41f3958f1de62cbfca20b817e66a&tokenId=8122
#    应返回 PNG（响应头 X-Image-Source: opensea），而不是 SVG 占位图
#
# ADMIN_SECRET — 管理员发分（Secret，仅 Functions 运行时）
# Cloudflare → Variables → Production → ADMIN_SECRET
# 本地发分: ADMIN_SECRET=xxx node scripts/grant-points.mjs 0xWallet 5000

# Deploy script only — NEVER commit .env with real keys
DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Optional — script tries several public RPCs if unset
# ETH_RPC_URL=https://ethereum.publicnode.com
# Or get a free key: https://www.alchemy.com or https://infura.io
# ETH_RPC_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
